\pard \s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \ri1007 \ql \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1  (NSBorderType)\b borderType\b0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the NSBox\'27s border type. Border types are defined in \b NSView.h\b0 ; currently, the following border types are defined:\
\fs14\
\pard \s4 \li2338 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx2338 \tx3753 \tx4146 \fs28 NSNoBorder\
\fi0 NSLineBorder\
\fi0 NSBezelBorder\
\fi0 NSGrooveBorder\
\fs14\
\pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 \fs28 By default, an NSBox\'27s border type is NSGrooveBorder.\
\fs14\
