\fs6\
\pard \s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \ri1007 \ql \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1  (void)\b setContentView:\b0 (NSView *)\i aView\i0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Sets the NSBox\'27s content view to \i aView\i0 , resizing the NSView to fit within the box\'27s current content area. The box is marked for redisplay.\
\fs14\
\pard \s57 \li2804 \fi-1292 \ri1007 \ql \tx2799 \tx3282 \tx3771 \fs28 \f0 \b \fs24 See also:\tab \f1 \b0 \fs28 \b \f3 -\f1 \'80setFrameFromContentFrame:\b0 , \b \f3 -\f1 \'80sizeToFit:\b0 , \b \f3 -\f1 \'80setNeedsDisplay:\b0  (NSView)\
