\fs14\
\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Sets the title to \i aString\i0 , taking into account the fact that an embedded \'aa&\'ba character is not a literal but instead marks the title\'27s \'aamnemonic.\'ba The character immediately following the \'aa&\'ba character will be underlined.\
